<title>USA: Pillsbury buys  Deli France of Argentina.</title>
<headline>Pillsbury buys  Deli France of Argentina.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pillsbury Co, a unit of Grand Metropolitan Plc, said Tuesday it acquired Buenos Aires-based  Deli France S.A..</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed. Deli France's 1996 sales are expected to reach about $20 million.</p>
<p>Deli France is an Argentine bakery and food service company, and is owner and franchisor of the Delicity retail bakery chain.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
